      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Breaking the connection between primeval energy and a wild Gu is the signature ability of restriction path. The path is rare, and very few restriction path Gu Masters exist. Among the Gu Masters facing battle space Gu in Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, none is a restriction path Gu Master. Lui Shuang recalls seeing the restriction path primeval break Gu in the treasure room and regrets not exchanging for it.",
      "chapters": [
        584
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_wild_gu",
        "gu_battle_space_gu",
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "gu_primeval_break_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tao Zhu cultivates restriction path. It is a branch of rule path, just as emotion path is a branch of wisdom path. People call him Restriction Expert because he is the expert of restriction path in his generation.",
      "chapters": [
        1042
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
